{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "30b890253d1692ed6e2197ee3b706b447f9e3217cba4ddfb559245027af8fbb0", "ja": "魔法界の危機！", "zh": "魔法界的危机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "424ae4d331a4b44a8812520e40fcda4f0720cd4f0180d0fa79017a0ca1c05932", "ja": "亜美との関係に思い悩む真美の下に、轟音と\r\n亜美の魔法の気配が届く。周囲のマナを吸い\r\n込む土くれの巨人に気付いた麗花は、周囲の\r\n生徒達に逃げるよう誘導しつつ、可奈を学園\r\n長の下へと走らせる。", "zh": "为与亚美的关系烦恼不已的真美身边，传来了巨响和\n亚美的魔法气息。注意到正在吸收周围魔力的\n泥土巨人后，丽花一边引导周围的学生们逃跑，\n一边让可奈跑到学园长身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "9264c5939ae9c6af32f65ded5e50de959378ca93d8c01ae2ac63771e9befe607", "ja": "亜美、今日も研究に没頭してたな……。\n……。", "zh": "亜美今天也一直埋头研究啊……。\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "b2de4da847d70004373a3136b923ba303b2c4b2a82f4089bf01f7033240ac7b1", "ja": "真美だって、生徒のままでいたかったよ。でもさ、\n魔法を安定させるためには、しょうがないじゃん……。", "zh": "真美也想一直当学生的。可是，为了让魔法稳定下来，也没办法啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1002_se", "source_sha256": "ee72869fa062d0382840bcd305752e13f13c855d3d0f4f5370fb8f76c972b19c", "ja": "ドオオオオオオン！！", "zh": "咚——————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "2c7ac518aa474932fd16a70bb2dd457a57d60695001ee644424fc8a21120a06d", "ja": "！！　な、なに？　この音。\n実験室の方向から……。", "zh": "！！什、什么？这声音……是从实验室那边传来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "b5d08f540cd79a4823a1f2d26b350e152a8e1e3bd4cd7e9e710a9538842e3f9c", "ja": "この気配は……亜美！？", "zh": "这气息是……亚美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "7ea5d2c95a96d83be3efe5f3c38603d985d569932f8b6dfcab8877394f853a76", "ja": "な、なに……？　あの土くれの巨人……。\n周囲のマナを吸い込んで、どんどん大きくなってる！", "zh": "什、什么……？那个泥土巨人……\n它正在吸收周围的魔力，越变越大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "076b0eb88b693c02173e4cf65a32315026a46e5d74c713c03e8c32363ad0b64d", "ja": "あの魔法……！？\nでも、これは……良くない感じがする。", "zh": "那个魔法……！？\n但是，总觉得……有些不妙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "85d91b6bc5060ebcc8a876883e17803f44607825cb3fca374c5b0ad85cd2cab1", "ja": "みんな、逃げて！　……ここは私にまかせて。\n可奈ちゃんは、先生達に報告！", "zh": "大家快逃！……这里交给我。\n可奈，你去向老师们报告！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "c1df3ca290d00aee8a0199a48d2554603e0543a460c06e59e31a888b1096c6ea", "ja": "学園長か、朋花ちゃんの指示を仰いで！\n……急いで！", "zh": "去请示学园长，或者朋花同学的指示！\n……快去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "b80dbd00eb84f328ed87de8a14de8c798c7548ababe1a888aecca4af9c6bb101", "ja": "は、はい！\n……っ！", "zh": "好、好的！\n……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "dca455fb70924e162c2efdd4f678a5fffc4a5a10362bfffbd48d3e853f9baa52", "ja": "（膝が、震えてる……？\n……怖がってるっていうの？　私が……？）", "zh": "（膝盖在发抖……？\n……难道说，是我在害怕……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0255_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_04_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "ee06f6d54d37892886f69e9daaecc47d9554074a57f7af4fcaef167def946435", "ja": "……っ！　なにやってるの！　私の力を\n見せつける時じゃない！　私が、やらなくちゃ……！", "zh": "……！你在干什么！现在不是展示我的力量的时候！我必须……亲自来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
